        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Ride the Wind"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(air, concentrate, primal, transmutation)\n\nTrigger: The wendigo casts wind walk while it has Grabbed a foe.\n\nThe wendigo attempts to turn the grabbed creature into wind and carry it along as part of the action. If the target succeeds at a 38 Will save, it prevents itself from being transformed; in this case, the wendigo still transforms, automatically releasing the victim. A creature forced to Ride the Wind along with the wendigo is exposed to wendigo torment. The target can attempt a new Will save each round to return to normal, though it immediately becomes corporeal and begins falling if it succeeds."
            },
